  "instructions": [
    "Combine flour, bicarbonate of soda, and sugar in a large mixing bowl.",
    "Add warm water and mix until a sticky dough forms.",
    "Knead the dough for 5 minutes until it becomes smooth and elastic.",
    "Place the dough on a greased surface and let it rise in a warm place for 1 hour.",
    "Preheat the oven to 180°C.",
    "Punch down the dough and shape it into a round loaf.",
    "Place the loaf on a baking sheet and bake for 25 minutes.",
    "Remove the loaf from the oven and let it cool on a wire rack for 10 minutes before slicing.",
    "Serve warm and enjoy!"
